  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khukhwama khu Paulo, niye kumulaango kwe khuuba omurumwa kuukhaama khu mundu namwe khu maani ko mundu tawe, ne kakhali khukhwama khu Yesu Kristo ne Wele Paapa owamulamusia niye khukhwama mu lifwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase boosi bali ano baambanile nase khuruma kimileembe khu kanisa cha Kalatia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Paapa wefwe no Mwami Yesu Kristo akhoya amuelesie enywe kumwalaalo ne kumuleembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo eana omwene khulwe bubwoni bwefwe, mu khuloonda lilienya lia Wele lundi Paapa wefwe, nio akhusikule efwe khukhwama khu selukho emayaanu yino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luyali lube khu Wele mindali na mindali! Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mumbukia! Mu siise sikeekhe busa mulikho mwanjukha oyo owamulaanga enywe khulwe kumwalaalo kwa Kristo, mala mulikho muloonda elomo ekiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali, “Elomo Endayi” ekiindi se liio tawe, ne kakhali ese mboola ndio sikila babaandu balala baliio balikho bamunaania enywe, ne khukhaka khukaluukhasia Elomo Endayi eya Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khwakhaba efwe namwe malaika khukhwama mwikulu ne elwacha khwinywe elomo lukano luluundi khukhwama khu niyo khwamwilwachila, akhoya alaamwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwalomakho khale, ne luno ndoma lundi, aaba bali yesi yesi amwilwachila elomo eli lukano luluundi khukhwama khu niyo mwafukiilila, akhoyeele alaamwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kalolekha nga ese olikho okhaka khufukiililwa ebweeni we babaandu busa ku? Ng'ali se kali kario tawe! Nilio nenya lili khufukiililwa ebweeni wa Wele! Namwe kalolekha nga ese olikho okhaka khukhwimanyisia khu baandu? Abanga ese ndikho khaka khukhola ndio, andi se ndi omukholi owa Kristo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nga Paulo ne ekela omurumwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekha muboolele enywe bawandaayase, ndi Elomo Endayi niyo nilwacha se yaama khu mundu busa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se nakinyoola khukhwama khu mundu tawe, namwe omundu yesi se anjikisia tawe. Yesu Kristo omwene niye owafunulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 8.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.4+ACT.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwaboolelwe ke limenya liase lie khaale, nga naba ne nerusilia elala khu dini eye Bayaudi. Napia ekanisa eya Wele siibi ne se nabakho ne siisa siosi siosi tawe, mala nakhola kamaani khu kionakaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bikh. 22.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naba ebweeni we Bayaudi basiaase be selukho yase mu likhola liase lie dini eye Bayaudi, mala nerusia lukali khuloonda kimiima kie bakuuka befwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
